Local regulations (lokale-forskrifter/)
---------------------------------------

The local regulations in lokale-forskrifter/ are NOT Lovdata data and are NOT
licensed under NLOD 2.0. Lovdata's public-data API does not serve them; they
are captured from the websites of the enacting kommuner and fylkeskommuner.

They are published on the basis of åndsverkloven § 14: laws, regulations and
other decisions by public authorities are not subject to copyright. Only
material classified as an enacted regulation is published on this basis.

Each document records ObservedAt provenance (when and from which URL its text
was observed). The material is observed, not asserted: it has not been
verified against Norsk Lovtidend or Lovdata, and the lovspor project does not
assert that any of it is in force, current or complete.
